<title>CHINA: Tokyo-Mitsubishi sets HK$2 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Tokyo-Mitsubishi sets HK$2 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi, acting through its Hong Kong branch, has launched a HK$2.0 billion floating rate certificate of deposit issue, lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (HK) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The three-year certificates were launched at par and pay a coupon of 20 basis points over the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
</text>
